              </?01M0XJ2FKBWXBTRY38AP0RHVB7>
              <Criterion #P4-T1-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0XJ2FKBWXBTRY38AP0RHVB8>
              The report separates Actor classes, fixture/official/compatible evidence, epoch reasons, cache metrics and normalized cost, fails every unexplained local divergence, and evaluates provider aggregate misses only through grouped SLOs.
              </?01M0XJ2FKBWXBTRY38AP0RHVB8>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task #P4-T2 { name = "Run broad recovery, static authority and final budget gates" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 1 } (
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P4-T2-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0XJ2FKBWXBTRY38AP0RHVB9>
              Focused, recovery, type, strict, diff and authority scans pass with no second Conversation/history/cache authority or Workflow leakage.
              </?01M0XJ2FKBWXBTRY38AP0RHVB9>
              <Criterion #P4-T2-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0XJ2FKBWXBTRY38AP0RHVBA>
              The deterministic matrix satisfies all structural/cost budgets; any available official live result satisfies G1 without threshold relaxation, while unavailable/unknown live status remains explicit for Mission verification.
              </?01M0XJ2FKBWXBTRY38AP0RHVBA>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Hooks [
